            "review_title": "Review at Mai Xuan Canh",
            "review_text": "Intrepid T\nOttawa, Canada88 contributions\n0\nFantastic Pho!\nDec 2016 • Couples\nWe were referred to this restaurant by a friend from Saigon as being a safe place for a North American to try street food. She was right. It is a great local place to to try authentic Pho, which was delicious! The big difference between Pho that we find at home and this local place is that the broth was flavoured with chicken, not with salt -- something I wish we would catch onto. The restaurant is conveniently located on a street right beside the post office and cathedral and is easy to find. Come hungry around mid-morning and look for the blue awning.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 8, 2017",
