            "review_text": "Teakha\n11 contributions\n0\nBest Local Food Ever!\nMar 2016 • Couples\nThis place is just amazing! We heard about this place from one of our TV show guys called Andrew Zimmern and we just had to check it out! \n\nWe tried the Duck Tongue which was to die for! I have never tried Duck Tongue in my life but this was just outstanding! \n\nThe Pho / Vermicelli Chicken was okay not that kick that you would get out of other Pho Noodles in Vietnam. Maybe it needed more chill and spices along with a squeeze of lime.\n\nWe didn't try much as we were so full but if I were to come back this place would be first on my list!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 4, 2016",
