            "review_text": "brendanhoranhk\nHong Kong, China143 contributions\n0\nQuick local style breakfast.\nJan 2016 • Couples\nStopped here for breakfast one morning.\nLots of local people, quite busy. Was centrally located near the post office.\n\nDid not have much in the way of English speaking people or a menu.\nHowever we ended up with a chicken pho noodle and a soy milk for breakfast.\nNothing special, nothing bad.\nQuite cheep as well.\nWas good to try other noodle dishes for breakfast.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 5, 2016",
